We use your data only to:
- read and reply to your message by email or WhatsApp;
- if you want to continue, prepare a needs discussion, proposal, and quotation;
- prevent misuse of the form, such as spam and automated submissions.

We do not add you to a newsletter or use your data for automated decisions or profiling.

Under the PDP Law, you have the right to:
- be informed about how your data is processed;
- access and receive a copy of your data;
- correct or complete your data;
- ask us to stop processing and delete your data;
- withdraw your consent at any time;
- delay or restrict processing;
- sue and receive compensation if your data is processed unlawfully.

Send your request to the email in "Who we are" and include the email address you used in the form. For security, we may ask you to prove that the email belongs to you. We fulfil access and correction requests within 3 x 24 hours of receiving them. Withdrawing consent does not affect processing carried out before the withdrawal.
